
@startuml A2_C4_Container

title A2. C4 Level 2 — Контейнеры СМП и синхронные / асинхронные связи

left to right direction

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam Padding 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10

skinparam package {
  BorderColor #B8C4CC
  FontColor #34495E
  BackgroundColor #FAFBFC
}

skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor #FAFBFC
  BorderColor #C5CDD3
}

skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowFontColor #475569
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10

skinparam component {
  BorderColor #84919C
  FontColor #344054
}

skinparam database {
  BorderColor #83A5CC
  FontColor #344054
}

skinparam queue {
  BorderColor #83A5CC
  FontColor #344054
}

rectangle "Terminal Simulator\n:8085" as TERM #F6DFC5
rectangle "Merchant / Acquirer Sim\n:8084" as MERCH #F6DFC5
rectangle "BIN Lookup\n:8096" as BIN #F6DFC5
rectangle "Web Dashboard\nReact :3000" as DASH #DCEEDC
rectangle "Gateway\nSpring Cloud Gateway :8080" as GW #DCEEDC
rectangle "Switch (Router)\n:8082" as SW #F4DDE5
rectangle "Authorization\n:8083" as AUTH #F4DDE5
rectangle "Card Management\n:8081" as CMS #F4DDE5
rectangle "Transaction Logger\n:8088" as LOG #E9DFF5
rectangle "Notification Service\n:8097" as NS #E9DFF5
queue "RabbitMQ\n:5672 AMQP\n:15672 Management" as RMQ #DCE9F8
database "PostgreSQL\n:5432" as DB #DCE9F8

TERM -[hidden]down-> MERCH
MERCH -[hidden]down-> BIN

DASH -[hidden]down-> GW

SW -[hidden]down-> AUTH
AUTH -[hidden]down-> CMS

LOG -[hidden]down-> NS

RMQ -[hidden]down-> DB

TERM --> GW : HTTP POST\n/api/transactions

MERCH --> GW : HTTP\n/api/simulator/merchant/**

DASH --> GW : HTTP\n/api/dashboard/**, /api/cards/**

GW --> SW : HTTP POST\nRewritePath:\n/api/transactions ->\n/api/internal/route

GW --> LOG : HTTP GET\n/api/transactions/**,\n/api/dashboard/**

GW --> CMS : HTTP\n/api/cards/**

GW --> TERM : HTTP\n/api/simulator/terminal/**

GW --> MERCH : HTTP\n/api/simulator/merchant/**

SW --> AUTH : HTTP POST\n/api/internal/authorize

SW --> MERCH : HTTP\n(AcquiringFeeClient)

AUTH --> CMS : HTTP GET /api/cards/{pan}\nPOST /reserve, POST /rollback

AUTH --> BIN : HTTP GET\n/api/bin/{bin} (issuerId)

SW ..> RMQ : AMQP publish\nsmp.transactions\nrk=transaction.log

RMQ ..> LOG : AMQP consume\ntransaction-log

CMS ..> RMQ : AMQP publish (outbox)\nsmp.card-events\nrk=card.*

RMQ ..> NS : AMQP consume\ncard-notifications

LOG -[#8B779F,dashed]-> DASH : WebSocket push\n/ws/transactions

AUTH --> DB : JDBC\n(limit_usage)

CMS --> DB : JDBC\n(cards, reservations, outbox)

LOG --> DB : JDBC\n(transactions)

NS --> DB : JDBC\n(notifications)

MERCH --> DB : JDBC\n(merchants, terminals, fees)

note bottom of TERM
  Terminal Simulator обращается к Card Management напрямую,
  минуя Gateway, чтобы получать тестовые карты.
end note

legend right
  |= Тип связи |= Значение |
  | Сплошная стрелка --> | Синхронный HTTP / JDBC |
  | Пунктирная стрелка ..> | Асинхронный AMQP |
  | <color:#8B779F>Штриховая стрелка</color> | WebSocket |

  == Цвета компонентов ==

  | <back:#F6DFC5>     </back> | Внешние системы |
  | <back:#DCEEDC>     </back> | Входной уровень |
  | <back:#F4DDE5>     </back> | Ядро процессинга |
  | <back:#E9DFF5>     </back> | Вспомогательные сервисы |
  | <back:#DCE9F8>     </back> | Инфраструктура |
endlegend

@enduml
